sentences.l:
or somewhere the great mouth of sharp war,
so thickly in his chest groaned up Agamemnon
from the depths, out of his heart,

for of him the son
signals to the guards, and Idomeneus’ follower,
Meriones;

And call out wherever you may go, and to be awake bid them,
naming from the father’s side, from lineage, each man,
giving glory to all;

sentences.t:
τίς δ’ οὗτος κατὰ νῆας ἀνὰ στρατὸν ἔρχεαι οἶος
νύκτα δι’ ὀρφναίην, ὅτε θ’ εὕδουσι βροτοὶ ἄλλοι,
ἠέ τιν’ οὐρήων διζήμενος, ἤ τιν’ ἑταίρων;
